1
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:53,030
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:55,930
[Episode 31]

3
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,930
[Tiecheng Construction]

4
00:01:07,470 --> 00:01:09,170
[Tiecheng Construction]

5
00:01:11,250 --> 00:01:13,210
[Tiecheng Construction]

6
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,710
Tell He to unload

7
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:21,000
the materials at the square. Hurry up.

8
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,700
Send someone to keep a close eye on it.

9
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:23,420
Got it.

10
00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:24,710
Alright.

11
00:01:27,970 --> 00:01:30,289
How's the demolition going
in the Siying Road neighborhood?

12
00:01:30,289 --> 00:01:31,570
Working on it.

13
00:01:31,570 --> 00:01:32,200
It's still early.

14
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,330
Maybe it'll change in a couple of days.

15
00:01:36,590 --> 00:01:37,650
What are you doing?

16
00:01:37,710 --> 00:01:38,900
What are you doing?

17
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:40,210
Don't get physical.

18
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,700
This is our Zhao family's house!

19
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:42,150
Exactly.

20
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:43,560
Why are you outsiders fighting over this?

21
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,780
Who do you think you are?

22
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:47,200
Bah! Have you no shame?

23
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,150
In the years before the old lady died,

24
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:50,640
none of you ever showed up.

25
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,150
Nonsense!

26
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:52,729
Our Changyou had been looking after her.

27
00:01:52,729 --> 00:01:53,280
The old lady said

28
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,590
this house goes to us.

29
00:01:54,590 --> 00:01:55,650
Exactly.

30
00:01:55,650 --> 00:01:57,200
Don't listen to her nonsense.

31
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,539
You're talking crap!

32
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:00,710
How long has your Changyou been dead?

33
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:01,930
Why are you only finding out now?

34
00:02:01,930 --> 00:02:02,480
Alright.

35
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,420
Stop arguing.

36
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:06,120
-The police are here.
-Let go of your hands. Come on.

37
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:06,870
Officer.

38
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:07,620
You're here.

39
00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:08,620
You tell her.

40
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:10,330
If this house had nothing to do with us,

41
00:02:10,330 --> 00:02:12,190
how would you have found us, right?

42
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:14,650
-It must be ours.
-These are all Zhao Changyou's relatives.

43
00:02:14,650 --> 00:02:15,250
It seems

44
00:02:15,710 --> 00:02:17,410
there's something wrong with this house.

45
00:02:17,410 --> 00:02:19,900
Is it your house?
Why should he open it for you?

46
00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:21,370
150. Open it for me.

47
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:22,500
Don't listen to her.

48
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:23,550
I'll give 200.

49
00:02:23,710 --> 00:02:24,460
Don't listen to her.

50
00:02:24,460 --> 00:02:25,430
Whoever pays—

51
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,130
200! 250!

52
00:02:26,130 --> 00:02:26,650
Listen to me.

53
00:02:26,650 --> 00:02:27,190
Open it for me!

54
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:28,000
Open it for us!

55
00:02:28,930 --> 00:02:29,650
Whoever pays,

56
00:02:29,650 --> 00:02:31,020
isn't it the same door being opened?

57
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:32,430
What are you fighting over?

58
00:02:32,430 --> 00:02:33,490
Making such a fuss!

59
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:34,980
Listen to me.

60
00:02:35,579 --> 00:02:36,910
Once the door is opened,

61
00:02:37,190 --> 00:02:38,390
you all wait outside.

62
00:02:38,970 --> 00:02:40,620
The stuff inside
might be involved in a case.

63
00:02:40,620 --> 00:02:42,000
Once we've investigated thoroughly,

64
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,860
we'll resolve your issue.

65
00:02:42,860 --> 00:02:43,660
Do you hear me?

66
00:02:43,810 --> 00:02:45,020
Come on, come out.

67
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:46,950
Come out in an orderly way. Come on.

68
00:02:48,370 --> 00:02:49,120
Stop fighting.

69
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:49,980
Stop fighting.

70
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:51,860
You don't even have the property deed,

71
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:53,840
and you still want to occupy our house?

72
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,100
Come on, open the door.

73
00:02:59,180 --> 00:02:59,930
If the stuff inside

74
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:01,620
is really related to the case,

75
00:03:01,620 --> 00:03:02,960
we need to keep a close eye on it.

76
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,530
Watch it.

77
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,060
Don't worry, Juan.

78
00:03:29,170 --> 00:03:29,900
Flashlight.

79
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,520
What's this smell?

80
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,920
Hello? Who are you looking for?

81
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:39,480
He Liang, it's for you.

82
00:04:42,830 --> 00:04:43,630
Hello?

83
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,190
Juan?

84
00:04:52,550 --> 00:04:54,450
Ma, take a look at this file.

85
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:57,620
Liang?

86
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,610
-When did you come back?
-Liang.

87
00:05:00,610 --> 00:05:02,120
-Give it to me.
-Why are you back?

88
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:02,770
Thank you.

89
00:05:02,770 --> 00:05:03,690
Liang's back.

90
00:05:03,690 --> 00:05:04,830
First time seeing you in a police uniform.

91
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:05,930
It fits you perfectly.

92
00:05:05,930 --> 00:05:06,450
Yeah.

93
00:05:06,690 --> 00:05:09,090
Liang, what treats
did you bring this time?

94
00:05:11,330 --> 00:05:13,120
I'm treating you guys to dinner tonight.

95
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,540
Liang, how long

96
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:16,470
are you planning to stay this time?

97
00:05:16,890 --> 00:05:18,870
That depends on how the case goes.

98
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,190
You should just transfer to Tiecheng.

99
00:05:21,190 --> 00:05:21,990
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

100
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,370
I'll follow orders.

101
00:05:25,890 --> 00:05:28,030
I haven't finished
sorting the Siying Road files yet.

102
00:05:28,030 --> 00:05:28,940
Give me a hand.

103
00:05:29,010 --> 00:05:29,720
Sure.

104
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,250
Come on.

105
00:05:30,250 --> 00:05:30,870
Right.

106
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:48,980
What?

107
00:05:49,570 --> 00:05:51,450
I helped you solve such a big case.

108
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:53,540
And you just bought me
a bag of sunflower seeds?

109
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:54,710
I was in a hurry.

110
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:57,630
I hung up your call
and bought a ticket right away.

111
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,320
What are you standing there for?

112
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,370
We only found out
when we contacted them for demolition.

113
00:06:17,370 --> 00:06:19,190
The old lady has been dead for years.

114
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:21,050
The house was never transferred.

115
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,750
None of her immediate
family members could be reached.

116
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:25,250
Instead, all those distant relatives

117
00:06:25,250 --> 00:06:26,100
popped up.

118
00:06:26,630 --> 00:06:28,390
That's when we found out
she had a grandson—

119
00:06:28,390 --> 00:06:31,040
that Zhao Changyou
who froze to death last year.

120
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:33,440
How did the dance hall owner
die in the room?

121
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,720
Isn't that what
you're supposed to find out?

122
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,370
Let me tell you.

123
00:06:36,370 --> 00:06:38,070
That guy was really strong.

124
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:38,830
He was stuffed

125
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:39,890
in the freezer for who knows how long.

126
00:06:39,890 --> 00:06:41,820
The meat was all frozen and rotten.

127
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:43,790
It took a lot of effort to get it out.

128
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,460
They had to scoop
the meat out spoon by spoon.

129
00:06:46,490 --> 00:06:47,310
That smell...

130
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,190
It was like pig offal.

131
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,240
Okay.

132
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,610
I'll read the report myself later.

133
00:06:54,340 --> 00:06:56,270
Is the on-site investigation over?

134
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:56,920
No.

135
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:59,190
We notified you
as soon as we got the report.

136
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:00,450
We're regular police.

137
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:03,050
We can only assist in solving the case.

138
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:05,560
The precinct sent
detectives and forensics.

139
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,220
They've collected evidence.

140
00:07:07,310 --> 00:07:08,910
But this case is still yours.

141
00:07:09,420 --> 00:07:10,950
We have to follow your lead.

142
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:12,800
My colleague will arrive tomorrow.

143
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:15,200
I'll go check out
the scene this afternoon.

144
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:17,310
You feel like eating?

145
00:07:17,310 --> 00:07:19,180
There's a place over there
that makes great blood sausage.

146
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:21,390
If you don't eat now, it'll be demolished.

147
00:07:21,390 --> 00:07:22,360
I'll skip it.

148
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,170
Where's Qianqian?

149
00:07:27,170 --> 00:07:29,030
How come I didn't see her just now?

150
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:30,010
She's at kindergarten.

151
00:07:30,010 --> 00:07:31,940
I can't bring her to work every day.

152
00:07:33,250 --> 00:07:33,830
No wonder

153
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:36,190
she hasn't called me lately.

154
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:37,620
What,

155
00:07:38,250 --> 00:07:40,650
you want to learn
Cantonese from her again?

156
00:07:41,890 --> 00:07:42,390
Juan.

157
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:45,480
Can I still stay

158
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:48,159
at your place for this business trip?

159
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:01,620
Come on, Director.

160
00:08:01,620 --> 00:08:03,100
Don't fake being drunk. Drink up.

161
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:04,070
Yeah.

162
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:05,300
Who's faking?

163
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:05,930
Come on.

164
00:08:05,930 --> 00:08:06,430
Drink.

165
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,070
Bottoms up.

166
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:07,900
We're watching.

167
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:09,420
No leftovers.

168
00:08:10,250 --> 00:08:11,510
Hey, Luo,

169
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:13,310
you two, stop being
all lovey-dovey over there, okay?

170
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:13,890
Exactly.

171
00:08:14,570 --> 00:08:15,890
Don't think I can't tell.

172
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:17,690
You two better take your glasses

173
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:19,300
and come to the two bosses here

174
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:20,560
to give a report, okay?

175
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,570
Stop it.

176
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:23,950
Report what?

177
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,910
Since when?

178
00:08:25,930 --> 00:08:27,130
What?

179
00:08:27,130 --> 00:08:28,060
Wang Hailong.

180
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:30,220
You two—how did I not see it?

181
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,720
Congratulations to you both.

182
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,030
Thank you.

183
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:34,840
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

184
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,840
Be good together.

185
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,809
Well...

186
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,549
Mr. Liu, Ms. Chen,

187
00:08:39,750 --> 00:08:42,270
I'd like to say something bold on this

188
00:08:42,289 --> 00:08:44,310
happy occasion.

189
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:46,060
Listen up.

190
00:08:46,890 --> 00:08:48,310
You two—

191
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:50,320
you've even had a child now.

192
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:52,650
When are you going to make it official?

193
00:08:52,650 --> 00:08:53,320
Right?

194
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,640
Yeah!

195
00:09:06,630 --> 00:09:07,130
Did I...

196
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,420
Did I say something wrong?

197
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:11,590
Well,

198
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:12,600
I...

199
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:14,000
I'll take a penalty drink.

200
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:14,860
Penalty drink.

201
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,440
Take a penalty drink.

202
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:20,670
Well,

203
00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:22,240
let me propose a toast.

204
00:09:22,290 --> 00:09:22,870
Juan.

205
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,080
I can't drink.

206
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,820
I'll have a beverage.

207
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:26,380
Okay.

208
00:09:27,290 --> 00:09:27,960
Liu Yang.

209
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:30,170
It's been hard for you.

210
00:09:30,170 --> 00:09:31,370
It's what I should do.

211
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:32,650
Well,

212
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,980
first, I wish the child

213
00:09:34,100 --> 00:09:35,140
a healthy growth.

214
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:36,630
Thank you.

215
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,010
Mrs. Liu.

216
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:41,860
Mrs. Liu?

217
00:09:41,890 --> 00:09:42,690
Mrs. Liu, huh?

218
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,380
Well, then they are family now.

219
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:45,840
Right?

220
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,080
I wish you a prosperous

221
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,100
life together.

222
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:49,490
Thank you.

223
00:09:49,770 --> 00:09:50,740
How about a cross-cupped toast?

224
00:09:50,740 --> 00:09:53,790
Cross-cupped!

225
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:56,030
Cross-cupped!

226
00:09:58,340 --> 00:09:59,190
Come on.

227
00:09:59,220 --> 00:10:00,120
Come on.

228
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,340
Cheers.

229
00:10:01,340 --> 00:10:03,580
I have to say,
the sister-in-law is the best.

230
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:04,520
Yeah.

231
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:06,200
Straightforward.

232
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,260
Straightforward.

233
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,080
Let's all raise our glasses!

234
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:15,770
Cheers!

235
00:10:15,790 --> 00:10:16,680
Cheers.

236
00:10:31,470 --> 00:10:33,200
Yes, let's have another toast.

237
00:10:35,970 --> 00:10:37,500
I'll go over there for a bit.

238
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:41,770
Qiu, are you full?

239
00:10:41,770 --> 00:10:43,000
I'm full.

240
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,960
-Are you?
-Mom, I'm so bored.

241
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:45,910
Then go play outside.

242
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:46,720
There are fish over there.

243
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,340
Ms. Liu.

244
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:48,530
You and Grandma take him

245
00:10:48,530 --> 00:10:49,960
to watch the fish outside.

246
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,890
-Let's go watch the fish.
-Be careful.

247
00:10:51,890 --> 00:10:52,480
Okay.

248
00:11:06,650 --> 00:11:10,460
Back then, you thought I was easy
to control since I came from a small town.

249
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:12,720
You took advantage of
my parents' illness and need for money

250
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,450
and forced me to marry your son.

251
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,390
After I married him,

252
00:11:16,390 --> 00:11:17,600
how did he treat me?

253
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,530
You and the old lady know very well.

254
00:11:23,110 --> 00:11:24,550
Whatever the consequences,

255
00:11:24,550 --> 00:11:25,750
you have to bear them.

256
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,630
You started it.

257
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:29,200
This is karma.

258
00:11:30,610 --> 00:11:31,660
Accept your fate.

259
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:34,630
Maybe you'll live a couple more years.

260
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,130
Still sleeping.

261
00:11:47,130 --> 00:11:47,770
It's fine.

262
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:13,770
Drink less.

263
00:12:13,770 --> 00:12:14,960
Look, your face is red.

264
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:15,820
I'm fine.

265
00:12:15,820 --> 00:12:17,370
Alright.

266
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,010
Drink less.

267
00:12:18,010 --> 00:12:19,470
Why do they keep toasting?

268
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,480
Hello, pager 9638.

269
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,260
The restaurant opens today.

270
00:12:58,260 --> 00:12:59,520
Remember to come and eat fried pork.

271
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:04,150
[People's Fast Food]

272
00:12:59,630 --> 00:13:01,320
Thank you all for

273
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:03,470
coming to our little restaurant.

274
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:04,480
That's it for today.

275
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,000
Just enjoy yourselves, okay?

276
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:06,880
Okay!

277
00:13:06,100 --> 00:13:08,820
[Good Friends Home Cooking]

278
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:07,870
Come on!

279
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:09,010
Pager 9638.

280
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,400
I forgot to tell you the address.

281
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:13,460
It's right behind the old hair salon.

282
00:13:13,530 --> 00:13:14,240
Enjoy your meal. Take your time.

283
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:14,980
Pager 9638.

284
00:13:14,980 --> 00:13:15,790
Coming right up.

285
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,520
Hao Peng, are you coming or not?

286
00:13:18,510 --> 00:13:19,320
Pager 9638.

287
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,050
Really good.

288
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:22,600
I figure you're off
running around the world again.

289
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,520
When you return to Tiecheng,

290
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:25,720
don't forget to come and eat fried pork.

291
00:13:25,910 --> 00:13:27,520
I named the place

292
00:13:27,260 --> 00:13:34,400
[Good Friends Home Cooking]

293
00:13:27,710 --> 00:13:29,370
"Good Friends Home Cooking."

294
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:31,230
It means Hao Peng has a home.

295
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:32,500
From now on,

296
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:34,800
just treat this place as your home.

297
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:42,920
[Archives Room]

298
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:41,620
Juan.

299
00:13:42,620 --> 00:13:43,860
I saw you downstairs just now.

300
00:13:43,860 --> 00:13:44,820
I thought it was you.

301
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:48,260
[Archives Room]

302
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,460
I have good news for you.

303
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:47,960
You've done a great job this time.

304
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:50,690
The chief even said
he wants to transfer you back.

305
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:51,290
Really?

306
00:13:51,290 --> 00:13:51,790
Really.

307
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,370
The old man finally figured it out.

308
00:13:55,580 --> 00:13:56,870
Don't tell anyone I said that.

309
00:13:56,870 --> 00:13:57,790
I won't.

310
00:13:58,510 --> 00:13:59,800
Have some seeds.

311
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:00,840
Thank you.

312
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,050
Well, Juan.

313
00:14:02,050 --> 00:14:02,630
I'll get back to work.

314
00:14:02,630 --> 00:14:03,430
Go ahead.

315
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:04,150
Okay.

316
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:10,840
[Chief's Office]

317
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,370
Okay. According to the list,

318
00:14:12,370 --> 00:14:13,830
call all these people back

319
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:14,870
for questioning.

320
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:17,020
That Liu Yang—call him back too.

321
00:14:17,350 --> 00:14:17,840
Okay.

322
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:18,910
Which Liu Yang?

323
00:14:19,620 --> 00:14:21,840
Does my brother
have anything to do with this case?

324
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:22,360
Juan.

325
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:25,030
Take a look. Do you know this person?

326
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:29,000
Isn't this Three Eyes?

327
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:30,500
His real name is Hao Peng.

328
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:32,630
Earlier we found
a business card at the scene.

329
00:14:32,630 --> 00:14:33,230
It was his.

330
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,440
Later, we found cigarette butts.

331
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,980
After forensic analysis,

332
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:37,840
we found they were also his.

333
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:40,170
We also found his footprints at the scene.

334
00:14:40,670 --> 00:14:42,000
I've always called him by his nickname.

335
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,440
I forgot his real name.

336
00:14:44,910 --> 00:14:45,910
Here's the thing.

337
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,410
We now suspect that

338
00:14:47,410 --> 00:14:49,840
Liang Zhendong
had long been buying wild animals

339
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,970
from Zhao Changyou.

340
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:52,010
And Hao Peng

341
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:55,370
used smuggled cigarette sales as a cover,

342
00:14:55,370 --> 00:14:57,080
but he's actually helping Liang Zhendong

343
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,410
distribute them there.

344
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:00,630
And Zhao Changyou's death

345
00:15:01,030 --> 00:15:02,820
is very likely related to both of them.

346
00:15:02,820 --> 00:15:04,340
Maybe this Zhao Changyou

347
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:06,550
spilled the warehouse address

348
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:07,530
after drinking.

349
00:15:07,820 --> 00:15:09,410
Those two got greedy.

350
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:11,650
Then for some reason they had a dispute,

351
00:15:11,650 --> 00:15:13,580
and Hao Peng killed Liang Zhendong.

352
00:15:13,580 --> 00:15:16,510
The body was hidden
in the freezer at that warehouse.

353
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,790
That can't be.

354
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,130
I've known

355
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:22,860
Three Eyes for years.

356
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,480
He's an honest kid,

357
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:25,900
and not too bright.

358
00:15:26,030 --> 00:15:28,410
He can't even count to twenty
without taking off his socks.

359
00:15:28,410 --> 00:15:30,810
No matter how reckless Liang Zhendong was,

360
00:15:30,820 --> 00:15:31,910
he wouldn't team up

361
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:33,150
with an idiot.

362
00:15:33,150 --> 00:15:35,080
You can't judge a book by its cover.

363
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:37,100
Maybe he's just too smart

364
00:15:37,100 --> 00:15:38,500
and fooled everyone.

365
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:40,220
But,

366
00:15:40,530 --> 00:15:42,620
this is all just speculation based on

367
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:43,880
the current evidence.

368
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:46,290
Then where is Three Eyes now?

369
00:15:46,510 --> 00:15:47,630
We haven't found him yet.

370
00:15:47,630 --> 00:15:48,230
That's why

371
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:50,440
we're calling all the relevant people back

372
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,440
for questioning.

373
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:52,770
I'll go ask my brother.

374
00:15:52,890 --> 00:15:53,630
Juan,

375
00:15:56,750 --> 00:15:58,050
you have to recuse yourself.

376
00:15:58,050 --> 00:15:58,850
We'll ask him.

377
00:16:04,170 --> 00:16:04,630
Okay.

378
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,790
When was the last time you saw Three Eyes?

379
00:16:07,790 --> 00:16:10,460
[Welcome]

380
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,150
It's been a while.

381
00:16:10,410 --> 00:16:12,360
I can't remember how long.

382
00:16:12,820 --> 00:16:13,550
About a week.

383
00:16:13,790 --> 00:16:15,190
Have you seen this knife?

384
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:17,250
No wonder he stopped us from calling

385
00:16:17,250 --> 00:16:19,030
the police when Dong went missing.

386
00:16:19,030 --> 00:16:19,870
Three Eyes.

387
00:16:20,290 --> 00:16:21,360
This knife is his!

388
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,890
He's the one who killed Dong!

389
00:16:22,890 --> 00:16:23,620
Impossible.

390
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:25,340
Absolutely impossible, officer.

391
00:16:25,340 --> 00:16:26,540
You must be mistaken.

392
00:16:27,010 --> 00:16:28,620
Hao Peng is a really good guy.

393
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,610
He never gets handsy

394
00:16:30,750 --> 00:16:32,200
when he comes to my salon.

395
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:34,600
Every time he just
gets a wash and a haircut.

396
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:36,130
Last time he came back from Guangzhou,

397
00:16:36,130 --> 00:16:38,130
he brought me a bottle of hand cream.

398
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:40,370
He said he'd come to eat fried pork

399
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:42,080
when my little restaurant opens.

400
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,360
But I've paged him several times

401
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,820
and he never got back to me.

402
00:16:44,860 --> 00:16:47,060
I'm worried something happened to him.

403
00:16:49,750 --> 00:16:51,030
At first,

404
00:16:51,030 --> 00:16:52,250
I hadn't seen this guy.

405
00:16:52,250 --> 00:16:53,650
Just speak normally.

406
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:57,320
I just knew recently

407
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:59,320
he was selling cigarettes for Dong.

408
00:16:59,670 --> 00:17:01,150
After Dong went missing,

409
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,970
he got a group of people
to renovate the dance hall.

410
00:17:03,970 --> 00:17:05,869
It looks like a veteran cadre center now.

411
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:05,780
[Hao Peng, Golden Imperial Dance Hall]

412
00:17:06,050 --> 00:17:07,490
And he said it was Dong's idea.

413
00:17:07,490 --> 00:17:09,859
When was the last time you saw Hao Peng?

414
00:17:13,339 --> 00:17:14,589
Does he have

415
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:16,290
any close friends?

416
00:17:17,010 --> 00:17:18,670
Have you heard of Siying Road?

417
00:17:25,869 --> 00:17:29,050
I felt something was wrong early on.
